  "question": {
    "text": "According to Bohr's principle, which is the correct relation between principle quantum number <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and radius of orbit <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>)</mo></math>?",
